  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 2026-11-17 - 10.0.0.0-Beta-03\n- Decoupled core.clean.aws from core.clean.messaging\n- Enhanced SubjectEventRouterBase to support case-insensitive payload property lookup when extracting nested payloads from incoming JSON messages.\n- Added JsonElementExtensions.TryGetPropertyIgnoreCase to locate JSON properties regardless of casing, improving compatibility with messages containing differently cased property names.\n- Updated message deserialization to use JsonSerializerOptions with PropertyNameCaseInsensitive = true for case-insensitive property mapping during deserialization.\n- Updated SQS message processing to use MessageProcessingResult for determining successful and unsuccessful processing outcomes.\n\n\n## 2026-11-04 - 10.0.0.0-Beta-02\n- Updated registration of IMessageFailureNotifier to AddScoped\n\n## 2026-11-03 - 10.0.0.0-Beta-01\n- Release first beta version of core.clean.messaging",
